{"material_id": "ntce.zhongxue.zonghe.2012a.q29.material.recovered", "text": "星期二的早上，天上下起了鹅毛大雪。王老师走进教室，笑容满面地对同学们说：“大家看，外面的雪景多漂亮！今天这节语文课让我们一起走进雪的世界，好好玩一下吧！”学生们欢呼雀跃，奔向门外。他们有的堆雪人，有的打雪仗，有的在讨论雪花的形状、特点，王老师也和学生一起观雪、玩雪，即兴吟诗作对……下课时间快要到了，王老师召集大家说：“下午作文课的任务是写一篇记叙文，我相信大家能够出色地完成任务。”后来，学生们根据自己的感受，写出了一篇篇精彩的作文。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b9834dda031372204d14e94eb38513b338ceb74e344bbaf7ac80ed4ed6d90d17", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2427, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2645, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 29, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "b9834dda031372204d14e94eb38513b338ceb74e344bbaf7ac80ed4ed6d90d17"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.zonghe.2012a.q29"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.zonghe.m1.k1", "ntce.zhongxue.zonghe.m5.k4"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.ability.ethics", "ntce.zhongxue.ability.literacy"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.301.r001", "ntce.outline.301.r002", "ntce.outline.301.r003"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.zhongxue.zonghe.2012a.q29"], "word_count": 218, "level": "zhongxue", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（中学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b9834dda031372204d14e94eb38513b338ceb74e344bbaf7ac80ed4ed6d90d17", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2427, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2645, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": 